# Generated code is ignored by exact path at the top of this file. A bare
# "*gen.go" was here too, which matches any file whose name merely ends that way
# — tokengen.go, pathgen.go — and would silently leave a hand-written one
# untracked. It currently protects nothing the specific rules do not.

